is revision will no longer be visible.","Edited {time} times","Cannot delete","The most recent revision cannot be deleted.","Need to delete sensitive information? Go to the specific edit where the information was added.","Most Recent","Edits",{"add":868,"filterByMerged":869,"placeholder":372,"title":870},"New label","Filter by who’s merged","Filter by label",{"code":872,"discussion":873},"Code","Discussion",{"add":875,"label":876,"placeholder":877,"select":878,"title":879},"New milestone","Milestones","Search milestone","Select milestone","Filter by milestone",{"btn":881,"tip":882},"Sign up free","Discover high-quality open-source projects easily and host them with one click",{"save_after":884,"save_before":885},"and is a temporary private repository","The repository was created to address a security vulnerability",{"customMyField":887,"customMyFieldTip":888,"des":889,"toGH":890},"Customize your domain","Get precise matching with over 100,000 open-source projects","Introduction","Visit GitHub",{"pipelinePass":892,"title":893},"Pipeline run passed","Rulesets","Security issues include sensitive information such as code security bugs and privacy leaks. Community users will not be able to view current issues before they are fixed.",{"changeTime":896,"updateTime":897},"Edit on","Updated on",{"cangjie":899,"huaweiCloud":904,"repo":916,"repoAudit":1069,"tips":1079,"trusted":1082},{"online":900},{"detail1":901,"detail2":902,"title":903},"About Playground","1.The Playground is a web-based online coding experience service provided on the official website of the Cangjie programming language. You can experience writing Cangjie code and running it in the web code editor. \n2.When you write code in the web code editor and click \"Run\", the code will run in the Sandbox on the backend server and return the results. \n3.For the sake of the stability and security of the Playground function, we have prohibited some system calls and retained some standard library interfaces that are not system calls. \n4.If \"Runtime Exception XXXX XXXX\" appears, it means that there is a disabled system call in your code. \n5.The Playground will not store any code of any developer. After you close the web page, the code will be deleted. Please save your own code properly.","Playground",{"bindAndAuthDesc":905,"bindAndAuthRecommend":906,"goRegisterAndVerify":907,"noHuaweiAccount":908,"skipBindSessionHint":909,"skipBindSingleLogin":910,"welcomeDesc":911,"welcomeDescNotCann":912,"welcomeLegalText":913,"welcomeTitle":914,"welcomeTitleNotCann":915},"Bind once, seamlessly access NPU computing power and development tools","Link Huawei Cloud Account (Recommended)","Sign up and complete identity verification","Don't have a Huawei Cloud account?","Valid for this session only; re-verification required after page close or timeout","Skip for now, use existing account for single sign-on","Tailored for the CANN community, CANNLab is an out-of-the-box cloud development environment integrating CANN software, NPU computing, and a WebIDE. It supports dual access via browser and local IDE, empowering rapid innovation on Ascend.","Huawei Cloud development environment, built-in development tools and NPU power are supported for coding, compilation, deployment, and optimization for efficient high-performance AI operator development.","Identity verification is required by law to use cloud resources:","Welcome to CANNLab: Your One-Stop Development Platform","Welcome to the Huawei Cloud Development Environment",{"browser":917,"code":935},{"download":918,"history":921,"recent":925,"star":926,"stared":928,"view":932},{"hint":919,"tab":920},"Only downloads from the last 3 months are shown. We'll automatically track updates to your downloaded projects and notify you with a badge when new updates are available.","Download History",{"button":922,"desc":923,"title":924},"View Browsing History","Continue exploring it later in Browsing History.","Saved to Browsing History","Recent Projects",{"all"